    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>Small containers for fragrant spices or perfumes originally intended to be carried to ward off infections. Perforated and usually globular, apple-shaped, or composed of fitted sections. [Source: Getty AAT]</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
